        "TileImage": "$($repository f63d8f4a-103a-4364-a542-9c4cc53c0773).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, your targets are members within Helen&apos;s Muffin Kitchen. They sell muffins within the morning and afternoon but at night, the muffins somehow kill people. Reports has shown that the muffins had contained Ricin and all of the deaths were connected to Helen West. Known as &apos; The Cook &apos; her popular figure within whittleton creek attracted mutiple buyers to buy her muffins and deaths has rose quickly. Elimate Helen West along with her 3 High Rank officals within her group, Goodluck.",
